    <!-- lameta-source {"folderType":"session","folderId":"INT_2021_0356","fieldKey":"description"} -->
    <Description>Agnès Ikeda talks about eleven shades of white and one impostor. There is a long passage about a single brush, which the artist calls "the elder".</Description>
